{"type":"message","id":"8e2569b2","parentId":"0c82abc5","timestamp":"2026-01-31T04:24:46.675Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You are upgrading the JOC Translator landing page. The existing page is solid but needs these specific upgrades.\n\n## Existing Files\n- /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/joc-translator/landing/index.html (full page — read it)\n- /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/joc-translator/landing/styles.css (read it)\n- /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/joc-translator/landing/main.js (read it)\n- /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/joc-translator/server.js (read it)\n\n## Upgrades Required\n\n### 1. Fix copyright year\nChange 2025 → 2026\n\n### 2. Add \"Team of Rivals\" Technology Section\nAfter the \"How It Works\" section, add a new section explaining the multi-agent adversarial QA architecture. This is a KEY differentiator:\n- Every estimate goes through a Planner → Executor → Critic pipeline\n- Adversarial agents catch errors before they reach your bid\n- 90%+ internal error interception (cite the arxiv paper concept)\n- Make it visual — show the pipeline flow\n- Reference: \"Powered by adversarial AI architecture inspired by organizational intelligence research\"\n- This is what makes JOC Translator different from \"just another AI tool\"\n\n### 3. Interactive Demo Section\nReplace or enhance the \"How It Works\" with an interactive mockup:\n- Show a sample scope of work snippet on the left\n- Show the mapped UPB line items on the right\n- Animate items appearing as if the AI is translating in real-time\n- Use realistic JOC data:\n  - Input: \"Remove existing VCT flooring and adhesive in Rooms 101-104. Install new 12x12 VCT in selected colors per finish schedule. Include 4\" rubber base.\"\n  - Output mapped lines: \n    - 02 41 19.19 0260 — Selective Demolition, Flooring, VCT Removal — 2,400 SF\n    - 09 65 13.33 0200 — Resilient Flooring, VCT, 12×12 — 2,400 SF  \n    - 09 65 13.33 1200 — Rubber Base, 4\", Straight — 480 LF\n  - Show confidence scores and source tracing\n\n### 4. Replace Testimonials with Pilot Program CTA\nRemove the placeholder testimonials (they say \"Coming Soon\" which looks bad). Replace with a \"Pilot Program\" section:\n- \"Join our founding pilot program\"\n- 5 slots available for JOC teams\n- What they get: free pilot on one real project, dedicated onboarding, custom UPB configuration\n- What we get: feedback to make the product better\n- More honest and compelling than fake testimonials\n\n### 5. Visual Polish\n- The existing design is clean but could use more energy\n- Add subtle CSS animations (fade-in on scroll, the demo section animation)\n- Make the \"Team of Rivals\" pipeline diagram animated\n- Ensure mobile responsive\n- Keep the Inter font and indigo/purple palette\n\n### 6. Footer Update  \n- Copyright 2026\n- Add \"Built by a construction professional who got tired of hand-matching line items\" — Doug's story is the selling point\n\n## Design Guidelines\n- Modern, professional, trustworthy — this targets government facilities teams\n- Not flashy/startup-y — these are institutional buyers\n- Show you understand JOC (use real terminology: UPB, coefficients, task orders, IG audits)\n- The page should feel like it was built by someone who DOES this work, not a tech company guessing\n\n## Output\nOverwrite all three files:\n- /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/joc-translator/landing/index.html\n- /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/joc-translator/landing/styles.css  \n- /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/joc-translator/landing/main.js\n\nKeep the server.js signup endpoint working (don't change the API contract)."}],"timestamp":1769833486673}}
{"type":"message","id":"24f47073","parentId":"8e2569b2","timestamp":"2026-01-31T04:24:51.284Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\n"},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me read the existing files first.","thinkingSignature":"Es0BCkYICxgCKkDQ4F2RCF2Jna5xIq3ZFzJScyWMWmbLvLPKHUwdfkEmsLX4fhEYXRfZPnhk3848UcQLcoU0CFc3uSlzBAigVPhFEgw26FBdgXXV1BOIBjQaDCIzViZ8q0WhZs08WCIwIx7rakUAQ7+nI3xsC12GhNrDDXtxKD37cehL98NE6PBAlCJUUPEZtcvxyfZ+vMzcKjXkCPBPwxLPj0CG/pLPdIe3Ppxi3CCkm3f8gqGhoM9bS6k/ilsb14uUvA0MmZta8p89sBLToRgB"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01RkhVKMfFuKaSWmNft5Qvr4","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/joc-translator/landing/index.html"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01DLm2RU2Sf1Aa5vbqq5kmRH","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/joc-translator/landing/styles.css"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_017x9eXwALxNeZJuNEcCqzyU","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/joc-translator/landing/main.js"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01BaauGXK3ceXGSz9d6efaFa","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/joc-translator/server.js"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-opus-4-5","usage":{"input":3,"output":263,"cacheRead":5189,"cacheWrite":5713,"totalTokens":11168,"cost":{"input":0.000015000000000000002,"output":0.006575,"cacheRead":0.0025945,"cacheWrite":0.03570625,"total":0.04489075}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1769833486674}}
{"type":"message","id":"d48d2c6d","parentId":"24f47073","timestamp":"2026-01-31T04:24:51.362Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01RkhVKMfFuKaSWmNft5Qvr4","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>JOC Translator — AI-Powered Job Order Contracting Estimation</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Transform construction documents into JOC unit price book line items in hours, not days. AI-powered estimation for facilities teams.\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <!-- Nav -->\n  <nav class=\"nav\">\n    <div class=\"container nav-inner\">\n      <div class=\"logo\">\n        <svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 28 28\" fill=\"none\"><rect width=\"28\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"url(#g1)\"/><path d=\"M7 14l5 5L21 9\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><defs><linearGradient id=\"g1\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"28\" y2=\"28\"><stop stop-color=\"#6366f1\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#8b5cf6\"/></linearGradient></defs></svg>\n        <span>JOC Translator</span>\n      </div>\n      <a href=\"#signup\" class=\"btn btn-sm\">Request Early Access</a>\n    </div>\n  </nav>\n\n  <!-- Hero -->\n  <section class=\"hero\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"badge\">Now in Early Access</div>\n      <h1>Stop hand-matching line items.<br>Let AI translate your JOC estimates.</h1>\n      <p class=\"hero-sub\">Upload your project documents. Get back unit price book line items mapped, quantified, and audit-ready — in hours instead of days.</p>\n      <div class=\"hero-cta\">\n        <a href=\"#signup\" class=\"btn btn-lg\">Request Early Access</a>\n        <a href=\"#how\" class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\">See How It Works</a>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"hero-note\">Built for facilities teams running JOC programs on RS Means, Gordian, and custom UPBs.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hero-glow\"></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Problem -->\n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"problem\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-label\">The Problem</div>\n      <h2>JOC estimation is stuck in the past</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-sub\">Every JOC project starts the same way: an estimator sits down with a scope of work, opens the unit price book, and begins the tedious process of matching line items by hand.</p>\n      <div class=\"pain-grid\">\n        <div class=\"pain-card\">\n          <div class=\"pain-icon\">⏱️</div>\n          <h3>Days per estimate</h3>\n          <p>A single renovation project can take 2–5 days to estimate. Your backlog keeps growing.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pain-card\">\n          <div class=\"pain-icon\">🔍</div>\n          <h3>Missed scope items</h3>\n          <p>Manual translation means missed line items, underpriced proposals, and change orders that eat your margins.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pain-card\">\n          <div class=\"pain-icon\">📋</div>\n          <h3>Audit headaches</h3>\n          <p>When the IG comes knocking, can you trace every line item back to the scope? Most teams can't — not quickly.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pain-card\">\n          <div class=\"pain-icon\">👷</div>\n          <h3>Estimator bottleneck</h3>\n          <p>Your best estimators are buried in spreadsheets. You can't scale JOC volume without hiring more bodies.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Solution -->\n  <section class=\"section section-dark\" id=\"solution\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-label\">The Solution</div>\n      <h2>AI that speaks JOC fluently</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-sub\">JOC Translator reads your construction documents the way your best estimator would — then maps every scope item to the right UPB line item, automatically.</p>\n      <div class=\"solution-grid\">\n        <div class=\"solution-card\">\n          <h3>Understands construction documents</h3>\n          <p>Powered by BluePrint AI, it reads drawings, specs, and scopes of work — not just keywords, but actual construction intent.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"solution-card\">\n          <h3>Maps to your UPB</h3>\n          <p>Whether you're on RS Means, Gordian, or a custom unit price book, JOC Translator maps to your specific line items and applies your coefficients.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"solution-card\">\n          <h3>Audit-ready output</h3>\n          <p>Every line item traces back to the source document. Full documentation trail for IG reviews and contract compliance.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- How It Works -->\n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"how\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-label\">How It Works</div>\n      <h2>Three steps. That's it.</h2>\n      <div class=\"steps\">\n        <div class=\"step\">\n          <div class=\"step-num\">1</div>\n          <h3>Upload your documents</h3>\n          <p>Drop in your scope of work, drawings, specs, or any project document. PDF, images, CAD — we handle it.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"step-line\"></div>\n        <div class=\"step\">\n          <div class=\"step-num\">2</div>\n          <h3>AI translates to JOC</h3>\n          <p>Our AI reads the documents, identifies every scope item, and maps them to your unit price book line items with quantities.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"step-line\"></div>\n        <div class=\"step\">\n          <div class=\"step-num\">3</div>\n          <h3>Review & export</h3>\n          <p>Review the mapped estimate, adjust as needed, and export to Excel or directly into your JOC management system.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Benefits -->\n  <section class=\"section section-dark\" id=\"benefits\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-label\">Why Teams Switch</div>\n      <h2>Built for how JOC actually works</h2>\n      <div class=\"benefits-grid\">\n        <div class=\"benefit\">\n          <div class=\"benefit-icon\">\n            <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <h3>80% faster estimates</h3>\n          <p>What took days now takes hours. Process more task orders without adding headcount.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"benefit\">\n          <div class=\"benefit-icon\">\n            <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"/><polyline points=\"22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <h3>Fewer missed items</h3>\n          <p>AI catches scope items human estimators overlook. Fewer change orders, better margins.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"benefit\">\n          <div class=\"benefit-icon\">\n            <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><polyline points=\"14 2 14 8 20 8\"/><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"13\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"13\"/><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"17\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <h3>Audit-ready docs</h3>\n          <p>Full traceability from scope to line item. Be ready when the inspector general calls.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"benefit\">\n          <div class=\"benefit-icon\">\n            <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"/><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <h3>Scale without hiring</h3>\n          <p>Handle more JOC volume with your existing team. Let estimators focus on judgment, not data entry.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"benefit\">\n          <div class=\"benefit-icon\">\n            <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"3\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"21\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"21\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"21\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <h3>Your UPB, your way</h3>\n          <p>Works with RS Means, Gordian, and custom unit price books. Applies your coefficients and multipliers.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"benefit\">\n          <div class=\"benefit-icon\">\n            <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <h3>Secure & compliant</h3>\n          <p>Your documents stay private. Built with government and institutional security requirements in mind.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Testimonials -->\n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"testimonials\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-label\">What People Are Saying</div>\n      <h2>Trusted by facilities teams</h2>\n      <div class=\"testimonials-grid\">\n        <div class=\"testimonial\">\n          <p>\"We were spending 3-4 days on every task order estimate. JOC Translator cut that to half a day. The ROI was immediate.\"</p>\n          <div class=\"testimonial-author\">\n            <div class=\"avatar\"></div>\n            <div>\n              <strong>Coming Soon</strong>\n              <span>Early Access Participant</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"testimonial\">\n          <p>\"The audit trail alone is worth it. When our IG reviewed our JOC program, we could trace every line item back to the scope document in seconds.\"</p>\n          <div class=\"testimonial-author\">\n            <div class=\"avatar\"></div>\n            <div>\n              <strong>Coming Soon</strong>\n              <span>Early Access Participant</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"testimonial\">\n          <p>\"We caught $40K in missed scope items on our first project. Items our senior estimator had overlooked for years.\"</p>\n          <div class=\"testimonial-author\">\n            <div class=\"avatar\"></div>\n            <div>\n              <strong>Coming Soon</strong>\n              <span>Early Access Participant</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Signup -->\n  <section class=\"section section-dark\" id=\"signup\">\n    <div class=\"container signup-container\">\n      <h2>Get early access to JOC Translator</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-sub\">We're onboarding facilities teams now. Join the waitlist and we'll reach out to set up your pilot.</p>\n      <form id=\"signup-form\" class=\"signup-form\">\n        <div class=\"form-row\">\n          <input type=\"text\" name=\"name\" placeholder=\"Your name\" required>\n          <input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Work email\" required>\n        </div>\n        <input type=\"text\" name=\"company\" placeholder=\"Organization (e.g., Baltimore City DPW)\" required>\n        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-lg btn-full\">Request Early Access</button>\n        <p class=\"form-note\">No credit card required. We'll reach out within 48 hours.</p>\n      </form>\n      <div id=\"form-success\" class=\"form-success\" style=\"display:none\">\n        <div class=\"success-icon\">✓</div>\n        <h3>You're on the list!</h3>\n        <p>We'll reach out within 48 hours to schedule your pilot.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Footer -->\n  <footer class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"container footer-inner\">\n      <div class=\"logo\">\n        <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 28 28\" fill=\"none\"><rect width=\"28\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"url(#g2)\"/><path d=\"M7 14l5 5L21 9\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><defs><linearGradient id=\"g2\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"28\" y2=\"28\"><stop stop-color=\"#6366f1\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#8b5cf6\"/></linearGradient></defs></svg>\n        <span>JOC Translator</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"footer-note\">Powered by BluePrint AI · Built for JOC professionals</p>\n      <p class=\"footer-copy\">&copy; 2025 JOC Translator. All rights reserved.</p>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n  <script src=\"main.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1769833491360}}
{"type":"message","id":"48dfad4a","parentId":"d48d2c6d","timestamp":"2026-01-31T04:24:51.410Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01DLm2RU2Sf1Aa5vbqq5kmRH","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*, *::before, *::after { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n\n:root {\n  --bg: #0a0a0b;\n  --bg2: #111113;\n  --surface: #18181b;\n  --border: #27272a;\n  --text: #fafafa;\n  --text2: #a1a1aa;\n  --accent: #6366f1;\n  --accent2: #8b5cf6;\n  --radius: 12px;\n}\n\nhtml { scroll-behavior: smooth; }\n\nbody {\n  font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  line-height: 1.6;\n  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n}\n\n.container { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }\n\n/* Nav */\n.nav {\n  position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100;\n  background: rgba(10,10,11,.8);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n}\n.nav-inner { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; height: 64px; }\n.logo { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.1rem; }\n\n/* Buttons */\n.btn {\n  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n  padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: .9rem;\n  text-decoration: none; border: none; cursor: pointer;\n  background: var(--accent); color: #fff;\n  transition: all .2s;\n}\n.btn:hover { background: var(--accent2); transform: translateY(-1px); }\n.btn-sm { padding: 8px 16px; font-size: .85rem; }\n.btn-lg { padding: 14px 28px; font-size: 1rem; }\n.btn-full { width: 100%; }\n.btn-ghost { background: transparent; border: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--text2); }\n.btn-ghost:hover { background: var(--surface); color: var(--text); }\n\n/* Hero */\n.hero {\n  position: relative; padding: 160px 0 100px; text-align: center;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n.hero-glow {\n  position: absolute; top: -200px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);\n  width: 800px; height: 600px;\n  background: radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(99,102,241,.15) 0%, transparent 70%);\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n.badge {\n  display: inline-block; padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 20px;\n  background: rgba(99,102,241,.1); border: 1px solid rgba(99,102,241,.3);\n  color: var(--accent); font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 24px;\n}\n.hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem); font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -.03em; margin-bottom: 20px; }\n.hero-sub { font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--text2); max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 32px; }\n.hero-cta { display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 24px; }\n.hero-note { font-size: .85rem; color: var(--text2); }\n\n/* Sections */\n.section { padding: 100px 0; }\n.section-dark { background: var(--bg2); }\n.section-label {\n  font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .1em;\n  color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\n.section h2 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.02em; margin-bottom: 16px; }\n.section-sub { font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--text2); max-width: 600px; margin-bottom: 48px; }\n\n/* Pain Grid */\n.pain-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }\n.pain-card {\n  background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius);\n  padding: 28px;\n}\n.pain-icon { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n.pain-card h3 { font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n.pain-card p { font-size: .9rem; color: var(--text2); }\n\n/* Solution Grid */\n.solution-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }\n.solution-card {\n  background: rgba(99,102,241,.05); border: 1px solid rgba(99,102,241,.15); border-radius: var(--radius);\n  padding: 32px;\n}\n.solution-card h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n.solution-card p { font-size: .9rem; color: var(--text2); }\n\n/* Steps */\n.steps { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }\n.step { flex: 1; min-width: 220px; max-width: 300px; text-align: center; padding: 0 20px; }\n.step-num {\n  width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 50%;\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent2));\n  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n  font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 0 auto 16px;\n}\n.step h3 { font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n.step p { font-size: .9rem; color: var(--text2); }\n.step-line {\n  width: 60px; height: 2px; background: var(--border); margin-top: 24px; flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n/* Benefits */\n.benefits-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 24px; }\n.benefit { display: flex; gap: 16px; }\n.benefit-icon {\n  flex-shrink: 0; width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 10px;\n  background: rgba(99,102,241,.1); color: var(--accent);\n  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n}\n.benefit h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 4px; }\n.benefit p { font-size: .9rem; color: var(--text2); }\n\n/* Testimonials */\n.testimonials-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }\n.testimonial {\n  background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius);\n  padding: 28px;\n}\n.testimonial p { font-size: .95rem; font-style: italic; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 20px; }\n.testimonial-author { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }\n.avatar { width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--border); }\n.testimonial-author strong { display: block; font-size: .9rem; }\n.testimonial-author span { font-size: .8rem; color: var(--text2); }\n\n/* Signup */\n.signup-container { max-width: 520px; text-align: center; }\n.signup-form { margin-top: 32px; }\n.form-row { display: flex; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n.form-row input { flex: 1; }\n.signup-form input {\n  width: 100%; padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: 8px;\n  background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  color: var(--text); font-size: .95rem; font-family: inherit;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\n.signup-form input:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--accent); }\n.signup-form input::placeholder { color: var(--text2); }\n.form-note { font-size: .8rem; color: var(--text2); margin-top: 12px; }\n.form-success { margin-top: 32px; }\n.success-icon {\n  width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%;\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent2));\n  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n  font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 auto 16px;\n}\n.form-success h3 { margin-bottom: 8px; }\n.form-success p { color: var(--text2); }\n\n/* Footer */\n.footer { padding: 48px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }\n.footer-inner { text-align: center; }\n.footer .logo { justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n.footer-note { font-size: .85rem; color: var(--text2); margin-bottom: 4px; }\n.footer-copy { font-size: .8rem; color: var(--text2); }\n\n/* Mobile */\n@media (max-width: 640px) {\n  .hero { padding: 120px 0 60px; }\n  .section { padding: 64px 0; }\n  .form-row { flex-direction: column; }\n  .step-line { display: none; }\n  .steps { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 32px; }\n}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1769833491408}}
{"type":"message","id":"9cf9a3d6","parentId":"48dfad4a","timestamp":"2026-01-31T04:24:51.414Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_017x9eXwALxNeZJuNEcCqzyU","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"document.getElementById('signup-form').addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {\n  e.preventDefault();\n  const form = e.target;\n  const data = {\n    name: form.name.value.trim(),\n    email: form.email.value.trim(),\n    company: form.company.value.trim(),\n  };\n\n  try {\n    const res = await fetch('/api/signup', {\n      method: 'POST',\n      headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\n      body: JSON.stringify(data),\n    });\n    if (!res.ok) throw new Error('Request failed');\n    form.style.display = 'none';\n    document.getElementById('form-success').style.display = 'block';\n  } catch (err) {\n    alert('Something went wrong. Please try again or email us directly.');\n  }\n});\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1769833491413}}
{"type":"message","id":"7d470a06","parentId":"9cf9a3d6","timestamp":"2026-01-31T04:24:51.428Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01BaauGXK3ceXGSz9d6efaFa","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"const express = require('express');\nconst fs = require('fs');\nconst path = require('path');\n\nconst app = express();\nconst PORT = process.env.PORT || 3800;\nconst SIGNUPS_FILE = path.join(__dirname, 'data', 'signups.json');\n\napp.use(express.json());\napp.use(express.static(path.join(__dirname, 'landing')));\n\n// Ensure data dir\nfs.mkdirSync(path.join(__dirname, 'data'), { recursive: true });\nif (!fs.existsSync(SIGNUPS_FILE)) fs.writeFileSync(SIGNUPS_FILE, '[]');\n\napp.post('/api/signup', (req, res) => {\n  const { name, email, company } = req.body;\n  if (!name || !email || !company) return res.status(400).json({ error: 'All fields required' });\n\n  const signups = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(SIGNUPS_FILE, 'utf8'));\n  signups.push({ name, email, company, date: new Date().toISOString() });\n  fs.writeFileSync(SIGNUPS_FILE, JSON.stringify(signups, null, 2));\n\n  console.log(`New signup: ${name} <${email}> @ ${company}`);\n  res.json({ ok: true });\n});\n\napp.get('/api/signups', (req, res) => {\n  const signups = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(SIGNUPS_FILE, 'utf8'));\n  res.json(signups);\n});\n\napp.listen(PORT, () => console.log(`JOC Translator landing → http://localhost:${PORT}`));\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1769833491416}}
{"type":"message","id":"b9fa15e5","parentId":"7d470a06","timestamp":"2026-01-31T04:26:11.736Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I'll write all three updated files."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01MqpVbjkhrG4Mf73UC4kECh","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/joc-translator/landing/index.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>JOC Translator — AI-Powered Job Order Contracting Estimation</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Transform construction documents into JOC unit price book line items in hours, not days. AI-powered estimation for facilities teams.\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <!-- Nav -->\n  <nav class=\"nav\">\n    <div class=\"container nav-inner\">\n      <div class=\"logo\">\n        <svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 28 28\" fill=\"none\"><rect width=\"28\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"url(#g1)\"/><path d=\"M7 14l5 5L21 9\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><defs><linearGradient id=\"g1\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"28\" y2=\"28\"><stop stop-color=\"#6366f1\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#8b5cf6\"/></linearGradient></defs></svg>\n        <span>JOC Translator</span>\n      </div>\n      <a href=\"#signup\" class=\"btn btn-sm\">Join Pilot Program</a>\n    </div>\n  </nav>\n\n  <!-- Hero -->\n  <section class=\"hero\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"badge\">Founding Pilot Program — 5 Slots Open</div>\n      <h1>Stop hand-matching line items.<br>Let AI translate your JOC estimates.</h1>\n      <p class=\"hero-sub\">Upload your project documents. Get back unit price book line items mapped, quantified, and audit-ready — in hours instead of days.</p>\n      <div class=\"hero-cta\">\n        <a href=\"#signup\" class=\"btn btn-lg\">Join the Pilot Program</a>\n        <a href=\"#demo\" class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\">See It In Action</a>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"hero-note\">Built for facilities teams running JOC programs on RS Means, Gordian, and custom UPBs.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hero-glow\"></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Problem -->\n  <section class=\"section fade-in\" id=\"problem\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-label\">The Problem</div>\n      <h2>JOC estimation is stuck in the past</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-sub\">Every JOC project starts the same way: an estimator sits down with a scope of work, opens the unit price book, and begins the tedious process of matching line items by hand.</p>\n      <div class=\"pain-grid\">\n        <div class=\"pain-card fade-in\">\n          <div class=\"pain-icon\">⏱️</div>\n          <h3>Days per estimate</h3>\n          <p>A single renovation project can take 2–5 days to estimate. Your backlog keeps growing.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pain-card fade-in\">\n          <div class=\"pain-icon\">🔍</div>\n          <h3>Missed scope items</h3>\n          <p>Manual translation means missed line items, underpriced proposals, and change orders that eat your margins.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pain-card fade-in\">\n          <div class=\"pain-icon\">📋</div>\n          <h3>Audit headaches</h3>\n          <p>When the IG comes knocking, can you trace every line item back to the scope? Most teams can't — not quickly.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pain-card fade-in\">\n          <div class=\"pain-icon\">👷</div>\n          <h3>Estimator bottleneck</h3>\n          <p>Your best estimators are buried in spreadsheets. You can't scale JOC volume without hiring more bodies.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Solution -->\n  <section class=\"section section-dark fade-in\" id=\"solution\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-label\">The Solution</div>\n      <h2>AI that speaks JOC fluently</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-sub\">JOC Translator reads your construction documents the way your best estimator would — then maps every scope item to the right UPB line item, automatically.</p>\n      <div class=\"solution-grid\">\n        <div class=\"solution-card fade-in\">\n          <h3>Understands construction documents</h3>\n          <p>Powered by BluePrint AI, it reads drawings, specs, and scopes of work — not just keywords, but actual construction intent.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"solution-card fade-in\">\n          <h3>Maps to your UPB</h3>\n          <p>Whether you're on RS Means, Gordian, or a custom unit price book, JOC Translator maps to your specific line items and applies your coefficients.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"solution-card fade-in\">\n          <h3>Audit-ready output</h3>\n          <p>Every line item traces back to the source document. Full documentation trail for IG reviews and contract compliance.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Interactive Demo -->\n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"demo\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-label\">See It In Action</div>\n      <h2>From scope of work to UPB line items</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-sub\">Watch JOC Translator read a real scope snippet and map it to unit price book line items — with quantities, confidence scores, and full traceability.</p>\n      <div class=\"demo-container\">\n        <div class=\"demo-panel demo-input\">\n          <div class=\"demo-panel-header\">\n            <span class=\"demo-dot red\"></span>\n            <span class=\"demo-dot yellow\"></span>\n            <span class=\"demo-dot green\"></span>\n            <span class=\"demo-panel-title\">Scope of Work</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"demo-panel-body\">\n            <p class=\"demo-sow\" id=\"demo-sow\"></p>\n            <div class=\"demo-cursor\" id=\"demo-cursor\">|</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"demo-arrow\">\n          <div class=\"demo-arrow-line\"></div>\n          <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M4 10h12m0 0l-4-4m4 4l-4 4\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          <span class=\"demo-arrow-label\">AI Translation</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"demo-panel demo-output\">\n          <div class=\"demo-panel-header\">\n            <span class=\"demo-dot red\"></span>\n            <span class=\"demo-dot yellow\"></span>\n            <span class=\"demo-dot green\"></span>\n            <span class=\"demo-panel-title\">Mapped UPB Line Items</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"demo-panel-body\" id=\"demo-results\">\n            <div class=\"demo-placeholder\">\n              <div class=\"demo-spinner\"></div>\n              <span>Waiting for scope input...</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"demo-controls\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-sm\" id=\"demo-run\">▶ Run Demo</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" id=\"demo-reset\">Reset</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Team of Rivals -->\n  <section class=\"section section-dark fade-in\" id=\"technology\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-label\">Our Technology</div>\n      <h2>Team of Rivals: why our estimates are different</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-sub\">Every estimate goes through an adversarial multi-agent pipeline. Three AI agents check each other's work — so errors get caught before they reach your bid.</p>\n      <div class=\"pipeline\">\n        <div class=\"pipeline-stage fade-in\">\n          <div class=\"pipeline-icon planner\">\n            <svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v18a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z\"/><path d=\"M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v18a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <h3>Planner</h3>\n          <p>Reads your scope documents, identifies every work item, and creates a structured extraction plan. Nothing gets skipped.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pipeline-connector\">\n          <div class=\"pipeline-connector-line\"></div>\n          <div class=\"pipeline-connector-dot\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pipeline-stage fade-in\">\n          <div class=\"pipeline-icon executor\">\n            <svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"16 18 22 12 16 6\"/><polyline points=\"8 6 2 12 8 18\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <h3>Executor</h3>\n          <p>Maps each scope item to UPB line items, calculates quantities, applies coefficients, and builds the estimate.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pipeline-connector\">\n          <div class=\"pipeline-connector-line\"></div>\n          <div class=\"pipeline-connector-dot\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pipeline-stage fade-in\">\n          <div class=\"pipeline-icon critic\">\n            <svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"14\" r=\"12\"/><line x1=\"14\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"14\" y2=\"14\"/><line x1=\"14\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"14.01\" y2=\"18\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <h3>Critic</h3>\n          <p>Adversarial review agent that challenges every mapping. Catches wrong codes, bad quantities, and missing items before you ever see them.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pipeline-stats fade-in\">\n        <div class=\"stat\">\n          <div class=\"stat-value\">90%+</div>\n          <div class=\"stat-label\">Internal errors intercepted before output</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stat\">\n          <div class=\"stat-value\">3×</div>\n          <div class=\"stat-label\">Every estimate reviewed three times automatically</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stat\">\n          <div class=\"stat-value\">0</div>\n          <div class=\"stat-label\">Unchecked assumptions in your final estimate</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"pipeline-note\">Powered by adversarial AI architecture inspired by organizational intelligence research. The same \"team of rivals\" approach that makes great organizations — now applied to your JOC estimates.</p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- How It Works -->\n  <section class=\"section fade-in\" id=\"how\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-label\">How It Works</div>\n      <h2>Three steps. That's it.</h2>\n      <div class=\"steps\">\n        <div class=\"step fade-in\">\n          <div class=\"step-num\">1</div>\n          <h3>Upload your documents</h3>\n          <p>Drop in your scope of work, drawings, specs, or any project document. PDF, images, CAD — we handle it.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"step-line\"></div>\n        <div class=\"step fade-in\">\n          <div class=\"step-num\">2</div>\n          <h3>AI translates to JOC</h3>\n          <p>Our multi-agent pipeline reads the documents, maps to your UPB, and quality-checks every line item automatically.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"step-line\"></div>\n        <div class=\"step fade-in\">\n          <div class=\"step-num\">3</div>\n          <h3>Review & export</h3>\n          <p>Review the mapped estimate, adjust as needed, and export to Excel or directly into your JOC management system.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Benefits -->\n  <section class=\"section section-dark fade-in\" id=\"benefits\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-label\">Why Teams Switch</div>\n      <h2>Built for how JOC actually works</h2>\n      <div class=\"benefits-grid\">\n        <div class=\"benefit fade-in\">\n          <div class=\"benefit-icon\">\n            <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <h3>80% faster estimates</h3>\n          <p>What took days now takes hours. Process more task orders without adding headcount.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"benefit fade-in\">\n          <div class=\"benefit-icon\">\n            <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"/><polyline points=\"22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <h3>Fewer missed items</h3>\n          <p>AI catches scope items human estimators overlook. Fewer change orders, better margins.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"benefit fade-in\">\n          <div class=\"benefit-icon\">\n            <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><polyline points=\"14 2 14 8 20 8\"/><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"13\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"13\"/><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"17\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <h3>Audit-ready docs</h3>\n          <p>Full traceability from scope to line item. Be ready when the inspector general calls.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"benefit fade-in\">\n          <div class=\"benefit-icon\">\n            <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"/><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <h3>Scale without hiring</h3>\n          <p>Handle more JOC volume with your existing team. Let estimators focus on judgment, not data entry.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"benefit fade-in\">\n          <div class=\"benefit-icon\">\n            <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"3\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"21\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"21\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"21\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <h3>Your UPB, your way</h3>\n          <p>Works with RS Means, Gordian, and custom unit price books. Applies your coefficients and multipliers.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"benefit fade-in\">\n          <div class=\"benefit-icon\">\n            <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <h3>Secure & compliant</h3>\n          <p>Your documents stay private. Built with government and institutional security requirements in mind.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Pilot Program -->\n  <section class=\"section fade-in\" id=\"pilot\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-label\">Founding Pilot Program</div>\n      <h2>Be one of the first five teams</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-sub\">We're not hiding behind placeholder testimonials. We're building this with real JOC teams, on real projects.</p>\n      <div class=\"pilot-grid\">\n        <div class=\"pilot-card pilot-you-get\">\n          <h3>What you get</h3>\n          <ul>\n            <li><span class=\"check\">✓</span> Free pilot on one real task order — your project, your UPB</li>\n            <li><span class=\"check\">✓</span> Dedicated onboarding with our team</li>\n            <li><span class=\"check\">✓</span> Custom UPB configuration (RS Means, Gordian, or yours)</li>\n            <li><span class=\"check\">✓</span> Priority access and founding-member pricing when we launch</li>\n            <li><span class=\"check\">✓</span> Direct line to the development team</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pilot-card pilot-we-get\">\n          <h3>What we get</h3>\n          <ul>\n            <li><span class=\"check\">✓</span> Your honest feedback on accuracy and workflow</li>\n            <li><span class=\"check\">✓</span> Real-world data to make the product better</li>\n            <li><span class=\"check\">✓</span> Understanding of how your team actually estimates</li>\n            <li><span class=\"check\">✓</span> A chance to build the tool JOC teams actually need</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pilot-slots\">\n        <div class=\"slots-bar\">\n          <div class=\"slots-filled\" style=\"width: 0%\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <p><strong>5 pilot slots available</strong> — accepting applications from JOC program managers and estimating teams</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Signup -->\n  <section class=\"section section-dark\" id=\"signup\">\n    <div class=\"container signup-container\">\n      <h2>Apply for the pilot program</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-sub\">Tell us about your JOC program and we'll reach out to see if it's a good fit.</p>\n      <form id=\"signup-form\" class=\"signup-form\">\n        <div class=\"form-row\">\n          <input type=\"text\" name=\"name\" placeholder=\"Your name\" required>\n          <input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Work email\" required>\n        </div>\n        <input type=\"text\" name=\"company\" placeholder=\"Organization (e.g., Baltimore City DPW)\" required>\n        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-lg btn-full\">Apply for Pilot Program</button>\n        <p class=\"form-note\">No credit card required. We'll reach out within 48 hours.</p>\n      </form>\n      <div id=\"form-success\" class=\"form-success\" style=\"display:none\">\n        <div class=\"success-icon\">✓</div>\n        <h3>Application received!</h3>\n        <p>We'll reach out within 48 hours to discuss your JOC program and schedule your pilot.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Footer -->\n  <footer class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"container footer-inner\">\n      <div class=\"logo\">\n        <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 28 28\" fill=\"none\"><rect width=\"28\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"url(#g2)\"/><path d=\"M7 14l5 5L21 9\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><defs><linearGradient id=\"g2\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"28\" y2=\"28\"><stop stop-color=\"#6366f1\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#8b5cf6\"/></linearGradient></defs></svg>\n        <span>JOC Translator</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"footer-note\">Built by a construction professional who got tired of hand-matching line items.</p>\n      <p class=\"footer-sub\">Powered by BluePrint AI · Built for JOC professionals</p>\n      <p class=\"footer-copy\">&copy; 2026 JOC Translator. All rights reserved.</p>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n  <script src=\"main.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-opus-4-5","usage":{"input":1,"output":5995,"cacheRead":10902,"cacheWrite":7848,"totalTokens":24746,"cost":{"input":0.000005,"output":0.149875,"cacheRead":0.005451,"cacheWrite":0.04905,"total":0.20438100000000003}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1769833491428}}
{"type":"message","id":"5d2a559b","parentId":"b9fa15e5","timestamp":"2026-01-31T04:26:11.763Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01MqpVbjkhrG4Mf73UC4kECh","toolName":"write","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully wrote 18382 bytes to /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/joc-translator/landing/index.html"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1769833571761}}
{"type":"message","id":"214fc370","parentId":"5d2a559b","timestamp":"2026-01-31T04:27:15.471Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01GyP3hvPzxXgY5XAxid9onB","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/joc-translator/landing/styles.css","content":"*, *::before, *::after { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n\n:root {\n  --bg: #0a0a0b;\n  --bg2: #111113;\n  --surface: #18181b;\n  --border: #27272a;\n  --text: #fafafa;\n  --text2: #a1a1aa;\n  --accent: #6366f1;\n  --accent2: #8b5cf6;\n  --green: #22c55e;\n  --amber: #f59e0b;\n  --radius: 12px;\n}\n\nhtml { scroll-behavior: smooth; }\n\nbody {\n  font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  line-height: 1.6;\n  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n}\n\n.container { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }\n\n/* Fade-in on scroll */\n.fade-in {\n  opacity: 0;\n  transform: translateY(24px);\n  transition: opacity .6s ease, transform .6s ease;\n}\n.fade-in.visible {\n  opacity: 1;\n  transform: translateY(0);\n}\n\n/* Nav */\n.nav {\n  position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100;\n  background: rgba(10,10,11,.8);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n}\n.nav-inner { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; height: 64px; }\n.logo { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.1rem; }\n\n/* Buttons */\n.btn {\n  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n  padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: .9rem;\n  text-decoration: none; border: none; cursor: pointer;\n  background: var(--accent); color: #fff;\n  transition: all .2s;\n}\n.btn:hover { background: var(--accent2); transform: translateY(-1px); }\n.btn-sm { padding: 8px 16px; font-size: .85rem; }\n.btn-lg { padding: 14px 28px; font-size: 1rem; }\n.btn-full { width: 100%; }\n.btn-ghost { background: transparent; border: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--text2); }\n.btn-ghost:hover { background: var(--surface); color: var(--text); }\n\n/* Hero */\n.hero {\n  position: relative; padding: 160px 0 100px; text-align: center;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n.hero-glow {\n  position: absolute; top: -200px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);\n  width: 800px; height: 600px;\n  background: radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(99,102,241,.15) 0%, transparent 70%);\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n.badge {\n  display: inline-block; padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 20px;\n  background: rgba(99,102,241,.1); border: 1px solid rgba(99,102,241,.3);\n  color: var(--accent); font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 24px;\n}\n.hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem); font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -.03em; margin-bottom: 20px; }\n.hero-sub { font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--text2); max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 32px; }\n.hero-cta { display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 24px; }\n.hero-note { font-size: .85rem; color: var(--text2); }\n\n/* Sections */\n.section { padding: 100px 0; }\n.section-dark { background: var(--bg2); }\n.section-label {\n  font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .1em;\n  color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\n.section h2 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.02em; margin-bottom: 16px; }\n.section-sub { font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--text2); max-width: 600px; margin-bottom: 48px; }\n\n/* Pain Grid */\n.pain-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }\n.pain-card {\n  background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius);\n  padding: 28px;\n}\n.pain-icon { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n.pain-card h3 { font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n.pain-card p { font-size: .9rem; color: var(--text2); }\n\n/* Solution Grid */\n.solution-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }\n.solution-card {\n  background: rgba(99,102,241,.05); border: 1px solid rgba(99,102,241,.15); border-radius: var(--radius);\n  padding: 32px;\n}\n.solution-card h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n.solution-card p { font-size: .9rem; color: var(--text2); }\n\n/* Interactive Demo */\n.demo-container {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;\n  gap: 0;\n  align-items: stretch;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n}\n.demo-panel {\n  background: var(--surface);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: var(--radius);\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n.demo-panel-header {\n  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\n  padding: 10px 16px;\n  background: rgba(255,255,255,.03);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n}\n.demo-dot { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; }\n.demo-dot.red { background: #ef4444; }\n.demo-dot.yellow { background: #f59e0b; }\n.demo-dot.green { background: #22c55e; }\n.demo-panel-title { margin-left: 8px; font-size: .75rem; color: var(--text2); font-weight: 500; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .05em; }\n.demo-panel-body { padding: 20px; min-height: 220px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .85rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--text2); }\n.demo-sow { display: inline; }\n.demo-cursor { display: inline; color: var(--accent); animation: blink 1s step-end infinite; }\n@keyframes blink { 50% { opacity: 0; } }\n\n.demo-arrow {\n  display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n  padding: 0 20px; gap: 8px;\n}\n.demo-arrow-line { width: 2px; height: 40px; background: var(--border); }\n.demo-arrow-label { font-size: .7rem; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .05em; writing-mode: vertical-rl; text-orientation: mixed; }\n\n.demo-placeholder { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; height: 100%; min-height: 180px; color: var(--text2); font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: .85rem; }\n.demo-spinner { width: 24px; height: 24px; border: 2px solid var(--border); border-top-color: var(--accent); border-radius: 50%; animation: spin 1s linear infinite; }\n@keyframes spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }\n\n.demo-line-item {\n  opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-12px);\n  transition: opacity .4s ease, transform .4s ease;\n  padding: 12px 0;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n  font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n}\n.demo-line-item.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); }\n.demo-line-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }\n.demo-line-code { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .8rem; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 500; }\n.demo-line-desc { font-size: .85rem; color: var(--text); margin: 2px 0; }\n.demo-line-meta { display: flex; gap: 16px; font-size: .75rem; color: var(--text2); }\n.demo-line-confidence { color: var(--green); font-weight: 600; }\n.demo-line-source { color: var(--amber); }\n\n.demo-controls { display: flex; gap: 8px; justify-content: center; }\n\n/* Pipeline / Team of Rivals */\n.pipeline {\n  display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: center;\n  gap: 0; margin-bottom: 48px;\n}\n.pipeline-stage {\n  flex: 1; max-width: 280px; text-align: center; padding: 0 16px;\n}\n.pipeline-icon {\n  width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 16px;\n  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n  margin: 0 auto 16px;\n  position: relative;\n}\n.pipeline-icon.planner { background: rgba(99,102,241,.15); color: var(--accent); }\n.pipeline-icon.executor { background: rgba(139,92,246,.15); color: var(--accent2); }\n.pipeline-icon.critic { background: rgba(245,158,11,.15); color: var(--amber); }\n\n.pipeline-icon::after {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: -3px;\n  border-radius: 18px;\n  border: 2px solid transparent;\n  animation: pulse-border 2s ease-in-out infinite;\n}\n.pipeline-icon.planner::after { border-color: rgba(99,102,241,.3); animation-delay: 0s; }\n.pipeline-icon.executor::after { border-color: rgba(139,92,246,.3); animation-delay: .6s; }\n.pipeline-icon.critic::after { border-color: rgba(245,158,11,.3); animation-delay: 1.2s; }\n\n@keyframes pulse-border {\n  0%, 100% { opacity: .3; transform: scale(1); }\n  50% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.05); }\n}\n\n.pipeline-stage h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n.pipeline-stage p { font-size: .88rem; color: var(--text2); }\n\n.pipeline-connector {\n  display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n  padding-top: 28px; width: 48px; flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n.pipeline-connector-line { width: 100%; height: 2px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), var(--accent2)); position: relative; }\n.pipeline-connector-dot {\n  width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent);\n  margin-top: -5px;\n  animation: flow-dot 2s ease-in-out infinite;\n}\n@keyframes flow-dot {\n  0% { transform: translateX(-20px); opacity: 0; }\n  50% { opacity: 1; }\n  100% { transform: translateX(20px); opacity: 0; }\n}\n\n.pipeline-stats {\n  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 32px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n.stat-value { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 800; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent2)); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text; }\n.stat-label { font-size: .85rem; color: var(--text2); margin-top: 4px; }\n\n.pipeline-note {\n  text-align: center; font-size: .85rem; color: var(--text2); max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;\n  font-style: italic;\n}\n\n/* Steps */\n.steps { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }\n.step { flex: 1; min-width: 220px; max-width: 300px; text-align: center; padding: 0 20px; }\n.step-num {\n  width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 50%;\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent2));\n  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n  font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 0 auto 16px;\n}\n.step h3 { font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n.step p { font-size: .9rem; color: var(--text2); }\n.step-line {\n  width: 60px; height: 2px; background: var(--border); margin-top: 24px; flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n/* Benefits */\n.benefits-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 24px; }\n.benefit { display: flex; gap: 16px; }\n.benefit-icon {\n  flex-shrink: 0; width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 10px;\n  background: rgba(99,102,241,.1); color: var(--accent);\n  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n}\n.benefit h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 4px; }\n.benefit p { font-size: .9rem; color: var(--text2); }\n\n/* Pilot Program */\n.pilot-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 32px; }\n.pilot-card {\n  background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius);\n  padding: 32px;\n}\n.pilot-card h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px; }\n.pilot-card ul { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }\n.pilot-card li { font-size: .9rem; color: var(--text2); display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start; }\n.pilot-card .check { color: var(--green); font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; }\n.pilot-you-get { border-color: rgba(99,102,241,.3); }\n.pilot-we-get { border-color: rgba(139,92,246,.3); }\n\n.pilot-slots { text-align: center; }\n.slots-bar { width: 100%; max-width: 400px; height: 8px; background: var(--surface); border-radius: 4px; margin: 0 auto 12px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--border); }\n.slots-filled { height: 100%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), var(--accent2)); border-radius: 4px; transition: width 1s ease; }\n.pilot-slots p { font-size: .9rem; color: var(--text2); }\n\n/* Signup */\n.signup-container { max-width: 520px; text-align: center; }\n.signup-form { margin-top: 32px; }\n.form-row { display: flex; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n.form-row input { flex: 1; }\n.signup-form input {\n  width: 100%; padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: 8px;\n  background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  color: var(--text); font-size: .95rem; font-family: inherit;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\n.signup-form input:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--accent); }\n.signup-form input::placeholder { color: var(--text2); }\n.form-note { font-size: .8rem; color: var(--text2); margin-top: 12px; }\n.form-success { margin-top: 32px; }\n.success-icon {\n  width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%;\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent2));\n  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n  font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 auto 16px;\n}\n.form-success h3 { margin-bottom: 8px; }\n.form-success p { color: var(--text2); }\n\n/* Footer */\n.footer { padding: 48px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }\n.footer-inner { text-align: center; }\n.footer .logo { justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n.footer-note { font-size: .9rem; color: var(--text2); margin-bottom: 4px; font-style: italic; }\n.footer-sub { font-size: .85rem; color: var(--text2); margin-bottom: 4px; }\n.footer-copy { font-size: .8rem; color: var(--text2); }\n\n/* Mobile */\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .demo-container { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0; }\n  .demo-arrow { flex-direction: row; padding: 12px 0; writing-mode: horizontal-tb; }\n  .demo-arrow-line { width: 40px; height: 2px; }\n  .demo-arrow-label { writing-mode: horizontal-tb; }\n  .pipeline { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 24px; }\n  .pipeline-connector { flex-direction: row; width: auto; padding: 0; height: 40px; }\n  .pipeline-connector-line { width: 2px; height: 100%; }\n  .pipeline-connector-dot { margin-top: 0; margin-left: -5px; }\n  .pipeline-stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 16px; }\n  .pilot-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 640px) {\n  .hero { padding: 120px 0 60px; }\n  .section { padding: 64px 0; }\n  .form-row { flex-direction: column; }\n  .step-line { display: none; }\n  .steps { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 32px; }\n}\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-opus-4-5","usage":{"input":1,"output":5462,"cacheRead":18750,"cacheWrite":6038,"totalTokens":30251,"cost":{"input":0.000005,"output":0.13655,"cacheRead":0.009375,"cacheWrite":0.0377375,"total":0.1836675}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1769833571763}}
{"type":"message","id":"6a07ea6a","parentId":"214fc370","timestamp":"2026-01-31T04:27:15.497Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01GyP3hvPzxXgY5XAxid9onB","toolName":"write","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully wrote 13999 bytes to /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/joc-translator/landing/styles.css"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1769833635495}}
{"type":"message","id":"457ace1b","parentId":"6a07ea6a","timestamp":"2026-01-31T04:27:38.322Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01FqWCLBYTQAxVfh5XfJJYtd","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/joc-translator/landing/main.js","content":"// Signup form\ndocument.getElementById('signup-form').addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {\n  e.preventDefault();\n  const form = e.target;\n  const data = {\n    name: form.name.value.trim(),\n    email: form.email.value.trim(),\n    company: form.company.value.trim(),\n  };\n\n  try {\n    const res = await fetch('/api/signup', {\n      method: 'POST',\n      headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\n      body: JSON.stringify(data),\n    });\n    if (!res.ok) throw new Error('Request failed');\n    form.style.display = 'none';\n    document.getElementById('form-success').style.display = 'block';\n  } catch (err) {\n    alert('Something went wrong. Please try again or email us directly.');\n  }\n});\n\n// Fade-in on scroll\nconst observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n  entries.forEach(entry => {\n    if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n      entry.target.classList.add('visible');\n    }\n  });\n}, { threshold: 0.1, rootMargin: '0px 0px -40px 0px' });\n\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.fade-in').forEach(el => observer.observe(el));\n\n// Interactive Demo\nconst SOW_TEXT = `Remove existing VCT flooring and adhesive in Rooms 101-104. Install new 12×12 VCT in selected colors per finish schedule. Include 4\" rubber base.`;\n\nconst LINE_ITEMS = [\n  {\n    code: '02 41 19.19 0260',\n    desc: 'Selective Demolition, Flooring, VCT Removal',\n    qty: '2,400 SF',\n    confidence: 96,\n    source: 'Scope ¶1: \"Remove existing VCT flooring and adhesive\"'\n  },\n  {\n    code: '09 65 13.33 0200',\n    desc: 'Resilient Flooring, VCT, 12×12',\n    qty: '2,400 SF',\n    confidence: 94,\n    source: 'Scope ¶1: \"Install new 12×12 VCT in selected colors\"'\n  },\n  {\n    code: '09 65 13.33 1200',\n    desc: 'Rubber Base, 4\", Straight',\n    qty: '480 LF',\n    confidence: 91,\n    source: 'Scope ¶1: \"Include 4\" rubber base\"'\n  }\n];\n\nlet demoRunning = false;\n\nfunction resetDemo() {\n  demoRunning = false;\n  document.getElementById('demo-sow').textContent = '';\n  document.getElementById('demo-cursor').style.display = 'inline';\n  document.getElementById('demo-results').innerHTML = `\n    <div class=\"demo-placeholder\">\n      <div class=\"demo-spinner\"></div>\n      <span>Waiting for scope input...</span>\n    </div>`;\n}\n\nfunction sleep(ms) { return new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, ms)); }\n\nasync function runDemo() {\n  if (demoRunning) return;\n  demoRunning = true;\n\n  const sowEl = document.getElementById('demo-sow');\n  const cursorEl = document.getElementById('demo-cursor');\n  const resultsEl = document.getElementById('demo-results');\n\n  // Reset\n  sowEl.textContent = '';\n  cursorEl.style.display = 'inline';\n  resultsEl.innerHTML = `\n    <div class=\"demo-placeholder\">\n      <div class=\"demo-spinner\"></div>\n      <span>Waiting for scope input...</span>\n    </div>`;\n\n  // Type SOW text\n  for (let i = 0; i < SOW_TEXT.length; i++) {\n    sowEl.textContent += SOW_TEXT[i];\n    await sleep(18);\n  }\n\n  cursorEl.style.display = 'none';\n  await sleep(400);\n\n  // Show processing\n  resultsEl.innerHTML = `\n    <div class=\"demo-placeholder\">\n      <div class=\"demo-spinner\"></div>\n      <span>Planner analyzing scope...</span>\n    </div>`;\n  await sleep(800);\n\n  resultsEl.innerHTML = `\n    <div class=\"demo-placeholder\">\n      <div class=\"demo-spinner\"></div>\n      <span>Executor mapping to UPB...</span>\n    </div>`;\n  await sleep(800);\n\n  resultsEl.innerHTML = `\n    <div class=\"demo-placeholder\">\n      <div class=\"demo-spinner\"></div>\n      <span>Critic reviewing mappings...</span>\n    </div>`;\n  await sleep(600);\n\n  // Build results\n  resultsEl.innerHTML = '';\n  for (let i = 0; i < LINE_ITEMS.length; i++) {\n    const item = LINE_ITEMS[i];\n    const el = document.createElement('div');\n    el.className = 'demo-line-item';\n    el.innerHTML = `\n      <div class=\"demo-line-code\">${item.code}</div>\n      <div class=\"demo-line-desc\">${item.desc} — ${item.qty}</div>\n      <div class=\"demo-line-meta\">\n        <span class=\"demo-line-confidence\">✓ ${item.confidence}% confidence</span>\n        <span class=\"demo-line-source\">${item.source}</span>\n      </div>`;\n    resultsEl.appendChild(el);\n    await sleep(100);\n    el.classList.add('visible');\n    await sleep(500);\n  }\n\n  demoRunning = false;\n}\n\ndocument.getElementById('demo-run').addEventListener('click', runDemo);\ndocument.getElementById('demo-reset').addEventListener('click', resetDemo);\n\n// Auto-run demo when scrolled into view\nconst demoSection = document.getElementById('demo');\nlet demoAutoRan = false;\nconst demoObserver = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n  if (entries[0].isIntersecting && !demoAutoRan && !demoRunning) {\n    demoAutoRan = true;\n    setTimeout(runDemo, 500);\n  }\n}, { threshold: 0.3 });\ndemoObserver.observe(demoSection);\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-opus-4-5","usage":{"input":1,"output":1661,"cacheRead":24788,"cacheWrite":5505,"totalTokens":31955,"cost":{"input":0.000005,"output":0.041525,"cacheRead":0.012393999999999999,"cacheWrite":0.03440625,"total":0.08833025}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1769833635497}}
