{"type":"message","id":"f81d8dc3","parentId":"5f882bb6","timestamp":"2026-01-31T04:27:48.089Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All three files updated. Here's what was done:\n\n1. **Copyright**: 2025 → 2026\n2. **Team of Rivals section**: Added after demo with animated Planner → Executor → Critic pipeline, pulsing icons, flowing dot connectors, and stats (90%+ error interception, 3× review, 0 unchecked assumptions)\n3. **Interactive demo**: New section with typing animation for a real VCT flooring scope, animated UPB line items appearing with codes, quantities, confidence scores, and source tracing. Shows Planner/Executor/Critic stages during processing. Auto-runs on scroll.\n4. **Pilot Program**: Replaced testimonials with honest two-column layout (what you get / what we get), 5 slots progress bar, no fake quotes\n5. **Visual polish**: Fade-in-on-scroll for all sections, animated pipeline connectors, cursor blink, spinner states, mobile responsive breakpoints for demo/pipeline/pilot grids\n6. **Footer**: Copyright 2026, \"Built by a construction professional who got tired of hand-matching line items\"\n7. **API contract**: Unchanged — still POSTs `{name, email, company}` to `/api/signup`"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-opus-4-5","usage":{"input":1,"output":285,"cacheRead":30293,"cacheWrite":1704,"totalTokens":32283,"cost":{"input":0.000005,"output":0.007125,"cacheRead":0.015146499999999999,"cacheWrite":0.01065,"total":0.0329265}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1769833658353}}
